      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've been feeling really weird lately. like my vision has been acting up, its like there are these sudden flashes of light and then it feels like a dark curtain is just drifting across one side of my eye. i've been super stressed at work and havent slept much so i'm thinking it's just eye strain or maybe a migraine or something. is it normal to see stuff like that when u are burnt out?",
