      "content": "i mean i know you say to see a doctor but i really cannot afford an emergency room visit right now and i can't get time off work today. it's probably just from staring at the screen too long, right? like, if i just take some extra melatonin and use some warm eye compresses and maybe some vitamin a drops, do you think that would help clear up the flashes? i just need something to get me through the weekend.",
